      "created": 1791195305257,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "On schedule * On Condition * On Event",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "On schedule * On Condition * On Event",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "E-30047FSzyQLKmp_pgBO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3417.560512965065,
      "y": 771.8500499096085,
      "width": 279.9754133583199,
      "height": 140.24123765454345,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6278520,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 97010552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791195484864,
      "created": 1791195469178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For a v2 formula, firing hands the whole job\nto the orchestrator: it decomposes the\nformula into a graph of beads, fans the ready\nsteps out across the pool’s agents, gates\neach step on its dependencies, retries\nfailures, and drives the graph to completion\noutside any session — now on a schedule or\nin response to events instead of a person\ntyping gc sling",
      "fontSize": 12.465887791514973,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For a v2 formula, firing hands the whole job to the orchestrator: it decomposes the formula into a graph of beads, fans the ready steps out across the pool’s agents, gates each step on its dependencies, retries failures, and drives the graph to completion outside any session — now on a schedule or in response to events instead of a person typing gc sling",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3LYdKbuhuyhgwyWt8bczN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2169.6645842603048,
      "y": 465.9787842921963,
      "width": 564.677232183163,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1059089672,
      "version": 566,
      "versionNonce": 1048421896,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791195822089,
      "created": 1791195637418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Orchestrator runs formulas, drives each bead graph\nforward, and reconciles live agents against what your\nconfig declares",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Orchestrator runs formulas, drives each bead graph forward, and reconciles live agents against what your config declares",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cnZQUU2veQr7chJ1-tZD1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2146.4899021690767,
      "y": 880.5955864148957,
      "width": 611.0265963656186,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2014486792,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 94824968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791195799448,
      "created": 1791195736757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bead store - durable work — every unit of work is a bead\nthat survives an agent crash, so the orchestrator always has\nground truth to resume from",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bead store - durable work — every unit of work is a bead that survives an agent crash, so the orchestrator always has ground truth to resume from",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HGd-eWo0gLE6dVYwEu02n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2156.2689234967916,
      "y": 990.2748935358684,
      "width": 597.759408466539,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 428029304,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 1648943112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791195931295,
      "created": 1791195882026,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Event bus - fires activity outward so humans and agents\ncan watch what’s happening",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Event bus - fires activity outward so humans and agents can watch what’s happening",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qhqsdiTWME_Ydnyt9VB8D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1908.6950196117493,
      "y": 1125.8722396755738,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1359097864,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1178990200,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791195926454,
      "created": 1791195923753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hCyBfuamewCYffGDlJpvd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3328.7206715340053,
      "y": 1171.4486399613452,
      "width": 1458.693824101474,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 395229048,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 1629198968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791196064794,
      "created": 1791196055574,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notice the shape of the loop: the orchestrator acts on sessions — spawning, stopping, restarting them — but reads their progress from the bead\nstore and event bus rather than being called back directly. The loop closes through shared state, which is why work survives a crash on either side.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notice the shape of the loop: the orchestrator acts on sessions — spawning, stopping, restarting them — but reads their progress from the bead store and event bus rather than being called back directly. The loop closes through shared state, which is why work survives a crash on either side.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
