    {
      "id": "EQb95lweiboleKVwKY234",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5700.078015136673,
      "y": 594.1892174352489,
      "width": 774.4393310546875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1023560312,
      "version": 185,
      "versionNonce": 973545592,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791200292878,
      "created": 1791198688303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A single agent can be scaled into a pool of identical workers sharing one queue:\neach tick the orchestrator runs the agent’s scale_check query to measure\ndemand and sizes the pool to it — up to max_active_sessions, never below a\nmin_active_sessions floor — retiring sessions that fall idle. Sessions are\ndisposable; the work they did survives them, because work lives in beads.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A single agent can be scaled into a pool of identical workers sharing one queue: each tick the orchestrator runs the agent’s scale_check query to measure demand and sizes the pool to it — up to max_active_sessions, never below a min_active_sessions floor — retiring sessions that fall idle. Sessions are disposable; the work they did survives them, because work lives in beads.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
